Description: ROCm random number generation library - dev
 The rocRAND project provides functions that generate pseudorandom and
 quasirandom numbers. The rocRAND library is implemented in the HIP programming
 language and optimized for AMD's latest discrete GPUs. It is designed to run on
 top of AMD's ROCm runtime, but it also works on CUDA-enabled GPUs.